{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 383314, "name": "Oleksandr Chernetskii", "username": "sparcher", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/sparcher/{size}/15345_2.png", "created_at": "2025-02-21T16:00:37.584Z", "cooked": "<p>dnf upgrade<br>\nsays:<br>\n<code>The java-17-openjdk package is deprecated</code></p>\n<p>I have installed</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-plaintext\">sudo dnf list installed *java*openjdk*\nInstalled packages\njava-17-openjdk.x86_64                                    1:17.0.14.0.7-6.fc41        updates\njava-17-openjdk-headless.x86_64                           1:17.0.14.0.7-6.fc41        updates\njava-21-openjdk-headless.x86_64                           1:21.0.6.0.7-6.fc41         updates\n</code></pre>\n<p>Can I<br>\n<code>dnf remove java-17-openjdk*</code><br>\nwithout consequences ?</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 3, "updated_at": "2025-02-21T16:00:37.584Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 1645, "reads": 37, "readers_count": 36, "score": 8232.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 145495, "topic_slug": "the-java-17-openjdk-package-is-deprecated", "display_username": "Oleksandr Chernetskii", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 9534, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/the-java-17-openjdk-package-is-deprecated/145495/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 383319, "name": "MatH", "username": "theprogram", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/{size}/53169_2.png", "created_at": "2025-02-21T16:12:34.403Z", "cooked": "<p>You could use repoquery to find if anything depends on them.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>dnf repoquery -q --installed --whatrequires packagename</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Here is some further instructions <a href=\"https://www.baeldung.com/linux/list-dependent-packages\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.baeldung.com/linux/list-dependent-packages</a></p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 3, "updated_at": "2025-02-21T16:12:34.403Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 13, "reads": 35, "readers_count": 34, "score": 77.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 145495, "topic_slug": "the-java-17-openjdk-package-is-deprecated", "display_username": "MatH", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": "mindshare", "flair_url": "book-atlas", "flair_bg_color": "51a2daff", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 63, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://www.baeldung.com/linux/list-dependent-packages", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "clicks": 9}], "read": true, "user_title": "Welcome Wagon", "title_is_group": false, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 16174, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/the-java-17-openjdk-package-is-deprecated/145495/2", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction